# Quillback Scavenger

## Lore

The Quillback Scavenger lives by his or her wits, wandering the wastelands collecting loose odds and ends and somehow surviving endless scrapes and dangerous situations. Scavengers often fall in with bands of traveling adventurers, and their exploits commonly make them folk heroes among their own people. They have insatiable curiosity, often leap before they look, and are prone to taking anything that catches their eye without asking.

The book calls it optional, but common on the Palladium World.

## GM Notes

In skills the Scavenger is the Vagabond with Detect Ambush, Detect Concealment and Find Contraband added, and it uses the Vagabond experience table.
